@@ -1,5 +1,14 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+
+- `GET /bookings/availability` lists the free slots of a room in a window,
+  optionally filtered by a minimum duration.
+- Overlap detection also covers a booking that contains another one.
+- Booking rules (future start, 30 minutes to 8 hours, room and user must
+  exist) apply to creation and to any patch that moves the room or the
+  schedule.
+
 ## 1.0.0
 
 - Rooms, users, bookings and amenities endpoints.
